  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat the peanut oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the pot and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the chicken from the pot and set aside.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken broth, soy sauce, and sesame seeds to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the ramen noodles to the pot and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Return the chicken to the pot and cook until heated through.",
    "Stir in the green onions and serve hot."
